			<name>Alchemy (Su)</name>
			<description>When using Craft (Alchemy) to create an alchemical item, you gains a +3 competence bonus on the Craft (alchemy) check. In addition, you can use Craft (Alchemy) to identify potions as if using Detect Magic. He must hold the potion for 1 round to make such a check.</description>
